Bridge Part I Here is what is happening right now: Kenny is using whammy bar to pull notes down
                and up. I strongly recommend messing around with bends, it should be fine! :)

If you are lucky to have floyd rose, here it is:
First note soluton: Pull a whammy bar up to grab a 14 fret note you and then go down.
Repeat for other notes. :)

