Percussion kicks in

First note soluton: Grab 9th fret and pull a whammy bar up to grab a 10th fret note.
Repeat until 16th fret note.. :)

15th soluton: Pull a whammy bar up to grab a 16 fret note you and then go down.
Repeat till the end. :)

